リ、「箱」に入れたの。ナラ{NICKNAME}、気に入るかなあ？","nextNodeIds":[731000505]},{"nodeId":731000505,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1704296770,"text":"アランニムバは戻ってきてないの？","nextNodeIds":[731000506]},{"nodeId":731000506,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4246,"speakerName":"アランミナリ","textMapHash":4237288378,"text":"うん、アランニムバは根の深い大樹と違って、止まらないアランナラ。","nextNodeIds":[731000507]},{"nodeId":731000507,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2229904218,"text":"えっ…じゃあ、アランミナリはずっと独りでここにいたのかよ。寂しいって思わないのか？","nextNodeIds":[731000508]},{"nodeId":731000508,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4246,"speakerName":"アランミナリ","textMapHash":590269266,"text":"「寂しい」ってどういう意味？","nextNodeIds":[731000509]},{"nodeId":731000509,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1758397762,"text":"えっと…その、独りぼっちの時、仲間が恋しいって感じ…？","nextNodeIds":[731000510]},{"nodeId":731000510,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4246,"speakerName":"アランミナリ","textMapHash":2873579082,"text":"ヴァナラーナにはいっぱいアランナラがいるから、アランミナリは全然「寂しい」じゃないよ。","nextNodeIds":[731000511]},{"nodeId":731000511,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4246,"speakerName":"アランミナリ","textMapHash":2027230114,"text":"でも、アランヤマとアランニムバは、ヴァナラーナから離れちゃった。昔、三つのアランナラは一緒にいて、何をやっても楽しかったの。","nextNodeIds":[731000512]},{"nodeId":731000512,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4246,"speakerName":"アランミナリ","textMapHash":1512948986,"text":"アランヤマのアランラカラリは強くて、弱いナラじゃ破れないほどだったの。アランニムバはお絵描き上手で、いろんなものを描いて、綺麗だった。","nextNodeIds":[731000513]},{"nodeId":731000513,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4246,"speakerName":"アランミナリ","textMapHash":1265325138,"text":"でも今は、アランミナリとアランミナリの「宝箱」しかいない…","nextNodeIds":[731000514]},{"nodeId":731000514,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3422644842,"text":"アランミナリ…","nextNodeIds":[731000515]},{"nodeId":731000515,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4246,"speakerName":"アランミナリ","textMapHash":548562074,"text":"平気なの。アランミナリにはたくさんの「宝箱」があるから。ナラがどうして、箱を開けるのが好きなのかは、わからないけど…","nextNodeIds":[731000516]},{"nodeId":731000516,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4246,"speakerName":"アランミナリ","textMapHash":1865692186,"text":"でもアランミナリは「宝箱」のオーナーだから、「宝箱」が好きなナラたち、アランミナリのことも好きになってくれるよね、そうよね？","nextNodeIds":[731000517]},{"nodeId":731000517,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4246,"speakerName":"アランミナリ","textMapHash":3656238602,"text":"でも、アランミナリはこれ以上「お宝」を持ってないの。うぅ…「箱」はしばらく、腹ペコ生活。","nextNodeIds":[731000518]},{"nodeId":731000518,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4246,"speakerName":"アランミナリ","textMapHash":3019198258,"text":"#アランミナリの「宝箱」は空っぽになるけど、ナラ{NICKNAME}はこれからもアランナラの友達でいてね。","nextNodeIds":[]}]},{"talkId":7310007,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":false,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_ALL","beginCond":[{"param":["7310015","3","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",